OL,3,GNEWSA'Targeted' free bus fares mooted
OL,4,Aby E&I president
OL,5,
OL,6,FA "targeted" free bus service could be
OL,7,Fpiloted before the end of this States
OL,8,Fterm, the Environment & Infrastructure
OL,9,Fpresident has told the BBC.
OL,11,FDeputy Adrian Gabriel said he would
OL,12,Flike to see "enhancements" to
OL,13,FStagecoach's services by 2029.
OL,15,FProposals for a pilot of free bus
OL,16,Ftravel were withdrawn after the bus
OL,17,Foperator raised "genuine concerns"
OL,18,Fabout the impact increased demand would
OL,19,Fhave.
